; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 20. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'sp5A_monologue'
sp5A_monologue.dialogstring_06856E! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will: Lilly and I set foot[N]upon the continent of Mu.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Would the continent that[N]was awoken from numerous[N]millennia of sleep welcome[N]us…?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu61_hint'
mu61_hint.dialogstring_0697C9! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2]Lilly begins to speak[N]from your pocket.[FIN][BOR:6][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Hey Will. I was[N]thinking a little.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Doesn't it look like these[N]stone statues are staring[N]at something?[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Look, the treasure box[N]over there is where the[N]two statues' lines of[N]sight cross, right?[FIN]If that's the case, I was[N]wondering if the other[N]statues aren't also[N]staring at something.[FIN]I guess I could be[N]overthinking it.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu62_hope_statue'
mu62_hope_statue.dialogstring_0698D2! `[DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][SFX:0][DLY:9]Found a prayer statue![N][PAU:3C][DLY:2]Prayer statue… Wasn't[N]there a room somewhere[N]with the same name…?[PAU:5A][END]`
mu62_hope_statue.dialogstring_069925! `[DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3]You've found the Statue[N]of Hope! But your[N]inventory is full![END]`
mu62_hope_statue.dialogstring_069975! `[DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][SFX:0][DLY:9]Found a prayer statue![N][PAU:3C][DLY:2]Prayer statue… Wasn't[N]there another room with[N]the same name…?[PAU:5A][END]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_0392DE! `[DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1]Offered the prayer statue![FIN]`
item_use_system.dialogstring_0392FB! `But nothing happened![END]`
item_use_system.dialogstring_03930B! `[DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3]An eerie voice could be[N]heard descending from[N]somewhere...[END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu63_spirits'
mu63_spirits.dialogstring_069BAA! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]O spirit of the sun[AD] O[N]Rama[AD][WAI][N]Bestow your power upon the[N]great ocean[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'sp5A_monologue'
sp5A_monologue.dialogstring_0685D3! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Ah…! The water[N]level's been reduced from[N]what it was just now…![FIN]We can now descend to a[N]lower level from[N]somewhere, can't we…!?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sE6_gaia'
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08E2F8! `[PRT:@dialogstring_08DE96]When thou began thy[N]journey, the Mu continent[N]surfaced to the sea level.[FIN]However, seawater has[N]still accumulated on many[N]sections of the continent.[FIN]When all of this water has[N]been removed,[FIN]thou wilt probably arrive[N]at the place where the Mu[N]continent's king, Rama,[N]sleeps.[FIN]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08E3A7! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Watch for narrow cracks[N]and low passages.[N]Psycho Slider can carry[N]thee through them.[FIN][RET]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08EC66! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Psycho Slider is a power[N]that only the young man,[N]Will, can use.[FIN]Thou art now able to do a[N]sliding attack. Again,[N]thou wilt also pass[N]through narrow passages.[FIN]Thou shouldst push the[N]attack button whilst[N]running.`

?INCLUDE 'mu66_altar_dialog'
mu66_altar_dialog.dialogstring_069CB7! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](It looks like this was[N]the cemetery for Mu's[N]people[AD])[END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu66_rama_spirits'
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_069F45! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Rama: I was once king of[N]Mu.[WAI][N]My body was lost long ago,[N]yet my spirit remains.[WAI][N]Look carefully. The souls[N]of my people still wander[N]here.[END]`
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_069FBE! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Rama: Listen to the souls[N]that have awakened.[WAI][N]Mu was divided when the[N]light appeared.[WAI][N]Even now, their memories[N]do not speak with one[N]voice.[END]`
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_06A0A6! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]A beam of light once shone[N]in from the heavens.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]We thought it was the[N]light of the gods and[N]knelt before it.[END]`
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_06A0EC! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]One year after we saw the[N]light of the gods, our[N]bodies started to undergo[N]a change.[FIN]Some people became thin,[N]some people grew to look[N]like boulders,[FIN]…and some people even[N]melted away so that they[N]looked like water…[END]`
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_06A154! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Our family and friends[N]transformed to monsters[N]before our very eyes and[N]stormed in to attack us.[FIN]We were shedding tears as[N]we raised our weapons[N]against them…[END]`
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_06A1C9! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]We couldn't bear this[N]awful state of affairs,[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]…so there were more than a[N]few people who thought we[N]should escape from here.[FIN]However, the continent of[N]Mu is an island on the[N]deep blue sea.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Beyond that, there was no[N]guarantee that we would[N]have arrived in some other[N]place where we could live…[FIN]This island did not have[N]the material for a ship.[FIN]It would immediately sink[N]if we had constructed it[N]from stone…[END]`
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_06A19E! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]What meaning would there[N]even be in going on living[N]if it went on like this…?[END]`
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_06A26D! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]So the people began[N]digging an undersea[N]tunnel.[WAI][N]They knew the work might[N]outlive them by centuries[AD][WAI][N]perhaps even by millennia.[WAI][N]Still they dug, trusting a[N]future they themselves[N]would never see.[END]`
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_069FE3! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]The undersea tunnel that[N]the people had dug is[N]inside here.[FIN]And with that, please take[N]this Mystic Statue.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu67_erik'
mu67_erik.dialogstring_06A36B! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: Waaaaaaah…[N]Somebody saaave me…!![END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu67_vampires'
mu67_vampires.dialogstring_0AFB45! `[BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme21]Vampire man: You did well,[N]finding the Mystic Statue[N]for us![FIN]I was thinking that[N]someone strange had turned[N]up at the palace but…[FIN]Pshaw. I was right to let[N]you free.[FIN][BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme22]Vampire woman: What are[N]you going on about?[FIN][CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme22]Even though you start[N]drooling when anything[N]that resembles prey turns[N]up…![FIN]Every single time that you[N]manage to get a hold of a[N]few young children, you're[N]always like that…![FIN][CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme22]Do you think of nothing[N]but eating…?[FIN][BOR:B][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme21]Vampire man: You're one to[N]talk![FIN][CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme21]Hey, wait. Now isn't the[N]situation to be having a[N]lover's quarrel.[FIN]First off, let's take that[N]Mystic Statue. You there![N]Prepare yourself…!![END]`
mu67_vampires.dialogstring_0AFCA0! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme22]Vampire woman: Hmph. So[N]much for him.[FIN][CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme22]Alright, you're next[AD]!![N]Get ready[AD]!![PAU:78][END]`
mu67_vampires.dialogstring_0AFCE4! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme21]Vampire man: You bastard[AD]![N]How could you do that to[N]my wife[AD]!! I'll never[N]forgive you[AD]!!!![PAU:78][END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu67_erik'
mu67_erik.dialogstring_06A38D! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Forget everything else-[N]stop the booomb[AD]! Hurry,[N]hurry[AD]!![END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu67_bomb'
mu67_bomb.dialogstring_06A4E9! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](A red wire and a blue[N]wire are hanging out of[N]the bomb[AD][FIN]Which one should I cut?)[N][PAL:0] Cut red[N] Cut blue[PAL:4]`
mu67_bomb.dialogstring_06A54E! `[CLR]The red wire is cut![END]`
mu67_bomb.dialogstring_06A566! `[CLR]The blue wire is cut![END]`
mu67_bomb.dialogstring_06A719! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](...........)[FIN](It was a dud.[N]I'm saved...)[PAL:0][END]`
mu67_bomb.dialogstring_06A57F! `[PAU:28][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: It stopped[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: I'm saaaved[AD]![FIN][CLD][DEF]Lilly speaks from inside[N]Will's pocket.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Sorry, Will.[N]I couldn't do anything.[WAI][N]My legs froze. I couldn't[N]even make my voice work.[WAI][N]I thought I was the[N]dependable one, but when[N]it mattered, I was[N]terrified.[WAI][N][AD]I'll stay in your[N]pocket a little longer,[N]if that's okay.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu67_erik'
mu67_erik.dialogstring_06A3B8! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: I won't tell anyone[N]that you transformed.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu67_neil_lily'
mu67_neil_lily.dialogstring_06A7C7! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme16]Neil: Will! Are you[N]safe[AD]?![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Will! Have you seen[N]Lilly? Is she okay?![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: I'm here[AD][END]`
mu67_neil_lily.dialogstring_06AA4C! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Sorry for making[N]you worry. But I had Will[N]to protect me so I'm okay…[END]`
mu67_neil_lily.dialogstring_06AA89! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Oh? Will's turned[N]out to be very manly too,[N]hasn't he?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu67_kara'
mu67_kara.dialogstring_06A894! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Never mind that.[N]How do we get off Mu?[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: We may already have[N]the answer.[WAI][N]That spirit, Rama, told[N]us about an undersea[N]tunnel.[FIN][CLD][DEF]Will tells everyone the[N]story of Mu and the people[N]who dug beneath the sea.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: They spent[N]their whole lives building[N]a road for people they[N]would never meet[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: And that road may be[N]our way out.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Then what are we[N]waitin' for? Let's go![END]`
